Here’s how CourseManagement.vue handles session dates and how it relates to SmartCalendar:

---

## 1. How CourseManagement Displays 上課日期 (Session Dates)

### Template (lines 103–109)

```103:109:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
            <td>
              <details v-if="getSessionDatesForRow(c).length" class="session-dates-cell">
                <summary>上課日期 ({{ getSessionDatesForRow(c).length }} 筆)</summary>
                <div class="session-dates-list">{{ formatSessionDatesSummary(getSessionDatesForRow(c)) }}</div>
              </details>
              <span v-else class="hint">—</span>
