## 2. Session Date Computation

### `getSessionDatesForRow(c)` (lines 676–718)

```676:718:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
/** 該列（可能合併多堂）的實際上課日期陣列，已排序去重；API 無資料時堂數制用預估日期 */
function getSessionDatesForRow(c) {
  const rows = c.rows || [c];
  const first = c.first || rows[0];
  const byId = sessionDatesByCourseId.value;
  const set = new Set();
  for (const r of rows) {
    const id = r.id != null ? String(r.id) : '';
    const list = byId[id];
    if (Array.isArray(list)) list.forEach((d) => set.add(d));
  }
  const paymentType = c.payment_type ?? first?.payment_type;
  const purchased = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(c.sessions_purchased ?? first?.sessions_purchased ?? 0) || 0,
    (Number(c.totalRemainingSessions ?? 0) || 0) + (Number(c.totalUsedSessions ?? 0) || 0)
  );
  const firstDateRaw = c.first_class_date ?? first?.first_class_date;
  const firstDate = firstDateRaw && String(firstDateRaw).trim() ? String(firstDateRaw).trim().slice(0, 10) : '';
  let daysForEst = ...
  ...
  if (set.size === 0 && (paymentType === 'session' || purchased > 0) && purchased > 0 && daysNum.length) {
    const startYmd = firstDate || getNextWeekdayYmd(daysNum[0]);
    const estimated = computeEstimatedSessionDates(startYmd, daysNum, purchased);
    estimated.forEach((d) => set.add(d));
  }
  return Array.from(set).sort();
}
```

Logic:
- Use `sessionDatesByCourseId` from the session-dates API for each row/group.
- If no API data and it’s a session-based course, fall back to `computeEstimatedSessionDates()` using `first_class_date`, `days_of_week`, and purchased count.

### `computeEstimatedSessionDates()` (lines 512–525)

```512:525:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
/** 堂數制：依首日與排課日推算前 N 個上課日（僅預估，不含請假/調課） */
function computeEstimatedSessionDates(firstClassDate, daysOfWeek, count) {
  if (!firstClassDate || !(Array.isArray(daysOfWeek) && daysOfWeek.length) || count <= 0) return [];
  const out = [];
  const d = new Date(firstClassDate.trim().slice(0, 10) + 'T12:00:00');
  const end = new Date(d);
  end.setFullYear(end.getFullYear() + 2);
  const days = daysOfWeek.map(Number).filter(x => x >= 1 && x <= 7);
  while (d <= end && out.length < count) {
    const ymd = d.toISOString ? d.toISOString().slice(0, 10) : ...;
    const dow = d.getDay() === 0 ? 7 : d.getDay();
    if (days.includes(dow)) out.push(ymd);
    d.setDate(d.getDate() + 1);
  }
  return out.slice(0, count);
}
```

This is a local estimate: iterates from `first_class_date` on allowed weekdays, no leave/reschedule handling.

### `formatSessionDatesSummary()` (lines 522–529)

```522:529:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
/** 日期列表顯示為 1/8、1/15…，多筆時可捲動 */
function formatSessionDatesSummary(dates) {
  if (!dates || !dates.length) return '—';
  return dates.map((ymd) => {
    const [y, m, d] = String(ymd).split('-');
    return `${parseInt(m, 10)}/${parseInt(d, 10)}`;
  }).join('、');
}
```

